ive voice response (IVR) session. To allow scalability and facilitate quick changes in your IVR flow, such as broadcasting messaging, you can create rules by using Microsoft Power Apps and then integrate them into your Copilot agent. This approach allows businesses to make real-time changes to the Copilot agents without needing to modify or republish the agent.","resourceUrl":"https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/training/modules/agent-rule-manager-contact-center-ivr/?WT.mc_id=api_CatalogApi","sourceType":"provider-catalogue"},{"id":"mslearn-357cc10a6b5faf4c","version":"2026-10-21T17:12:00+00:00","title":"Explore Windows 365 for cloud PC deployment","provider":"Microsoft Learn","category":"Programming","level":"Intermediate","hours":0.87,"skills":["Cloud Computing"],"cost":0,"rating":0,"learners":0,"online":true,"delivery":"online","setting":"indoor","hrdc":false,"instructor":"Microsoft Learn","hue":210,"description":"Explore Windows 365 \u2014 its role for cloud PC deployment, how it compares to traditional VDI, licensing and prerequisites, common use cases, and endpoint experience options like Windows 365 Boot and Switch.","resourceUrl":"https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/training/modules/explore-windows-365-intune/?WT.mc_id=api_CatalogApi","sourceType":"provider-catalogue"},{"id":"mslearn-2fb55d428ff79794","version":"2026-10-21T17:12:00+00:00","title":"Build solutions with Copilot Code","provider":"Microsoft Learn","category":"Programming","level":"Beginner","hours":0.57,"skills":["AI Tools"],"cost":0,"rating":0,"learners":0,"online":true,"delivery":"online","setting":"indoor","hrdc":false,"instructor":"Microsoft Learn","hue":210,"description":"Turn a business need into a working solution with Copilot Code, then refine it through AI collaboration and prepare it to share with coworkers.","resourceUrl":"https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/training/modules/build-solutions-copilot-code/?WT.mc_id=api_CatalogApi","sourceType":"provider-catalogue"},{"id":"mslearn-48794982c450